  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 26 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nOur overseas owner has issued clear instructions: this property MUST be sold before Christmas. Presenting an unprecedented opportunity in Gulf Harbour, this massive waterfront residence combines two penthouse dwellings into one exceptional apartment.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a sprawling waterfront residence with lift access, a flexible arrangement for multi-generational living, or a high-value opportunity to hold, split, or rent, the shear size and versatility on offer here cannot be matched at this price point.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\nIncluded Marina Berth: Comes complete with a sought-after 15-metre marina berth right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nExceptional Scale: Sprawling across three levels, constructed in solid tilt-slab concrete for complete peace of mind.\r\n\r\nLuxury & Privacy: 3 oversized bedroom suites, each featuring its own ensuite, private balcony, and minibar area.\r\n\r\nEntertainer’s Dream: Dedicated bar area, rooftop observatory, and vast open-plan living zones.\r\n\r\nGaraging & Storage: Two double garages (4 car parking total) plus 2 massive dedicated storage units.\r\n\r\nVersatile Layout: Keep as one massive multi-level mega-penthouse or explore options for multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nLocated moments from Gulf Harbour Marina, Wentwork schools, and daily ferry services direct to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nThe vendor’s deadline is firm we are taking all offers to the owner before Christmas. \r\n\r\nContact us today to secure your private viewing.",
